{
  "id": "sound_power",
  "title": "Sound Power",
  "description": "Calculate sound power in watts and sound power level in decibels. Includes conversions between acoustic power, sound intensity, and sound pressure levels.",
  "type": "calculator",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Sound Power Calculator\n\nCalculate sound power and sound power levels using standard acoustic formulas.\n\n**Key Concepts:**\n- Sound Power (W): Energy rate emitted by a sound source\n- Sound Power Level (dB): Logarithmic scale relative to 10⁻¹² W reference\n- Sound Intensity (W/m²): Sound power per unit area\n- Sound Intensity Level (dB): Logarithmic scale relative to 10⁻¹² W/m² reference"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "sound_power_w",
          "label": "Sound Power",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "W",
          "defaultValue": 0.01
        },
        {
          "id": "sound_intensity",
          "label": "Sound Intensity",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "W/m²",
          "defaultValue": 0.001
        },
        {
          "id": "distance",
          "label": "Distance from Source",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "m",
          "defaultValue": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "sound_power_level_db",
          "label": "Sound Power Level",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "dB",
          "defaultValue": 100
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "sound_power_level",
          "label": "Sound Power Level",
          "unit": "dB",
          "formula": "10 * Math.log10(inputs.sound_power_w / 1e-12)",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "sound_power_from_level",
          "label": "Sound Power from Level",
          "unit": "W",
          "formula": "Math.pow(10, (inputs.sound_power_level_db - 120) / 10)",
          "format": "scientific"
        },
        {
          "id": "intensity_from_power",
          "label": "Sound Intensity at Distance",
          "unit": "W/m²",
          "formula": "inputs.sound_power_w / (4 * Math.PI * Math.pow(inputs.distance, 2))",
          "format": "scientific"
        },
        {
          "id": "intensity_level",
          "label": "Sound Intensity Level",
          "unit": "dB",
          "formula": "10 * Math.log10(inputs.sound_intensity / 1e-12)",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "pressure_level",
          "label": "Sound Pressure Level (approx)",
          "unit": "dB",
          "formula": "10 * Math.log10(inputs.sound_intensity / 1e-12) + 0.2",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
